# This directory is bind-mounted read-only into the caddy container at /srv/downloads
# and served at https://{$DOWNLOAD_HOST}/. Put the signed release APK here as
# ongero.apk; see docs/11_RELEASE_AND_DISTRIBUTION.md.
#
# The directory is tracked, its contents are not (.gitignore excludes downloads/*.apk).
# It has to exist in the repository because a bind mount whose host path is missing is
# created by Docker as an empty DIRECTORY — which would silently serve nothing.
